THIRD-PARTY NOTICES FOR MADIRE OS

Madire OS's own code is written from scratch (AGENTS.md, section 11). This
file lists the third-party software that Madire OS ships or uses to build
what it ships, with each one's licence. It was created in 0.13.

No third-party code is kept in this repository or built into Madire OS's
kernel or programs.
Madire OS's own LICENSE, NOTICE and this file are at every ISO's root (1.0).

=============================================================================
Terminus 4.49.1 (the console font, an asset, since 1.2)
=============================================================================

What:     the bitmap font Terminus 4.49.1, by Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov,
          https://terminus-font.sourceforge.net/ : eight BDF files of the
          release package terminus-font-4.49.1.tar.gz (SHA-256
          d961c1b781627bf417f9b340693d64fc219e0113ad3a3af1a3424c7aa373ef79),
          kept unmodified in third_party/terminus/ with their SHA-256.
How:      an asset, not code (AGENTS.md section 11, item 6). Madire's own
          scripts/make-font.py converts the BDF files to C at build time;
          the kernel links the result (the glyphs of code page 437). The
          converted font is a Modified Version under the OFL and does not
          use the Reserved Font Name "Terminus Font".
Licence:  SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Copyright (C) 2020 Dimitar
          Toshkov Zhekov, with Reserved Font Name "Terminus Font". The full
          licence text is in third_party/terminus/OFL.txt, at
          /third_party/terminus/OFL.txt on every ISO; the details are in
          THIRD_PARTY_ASSETS.md (also at every ISO's root).

